    {
      "id": "claim_0b49a8976ee54bb9b8ace8f402dfb0ec",
      "statement": "The RAG workflow indexes documentation into the fixed Pinecone index `aoe-langchain-docs` and exposes separate management and chat API entrypoints: management calls `indexKnowledgeBase`, while chat validates nonblank input and invokes the RAG agent.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/web/app/api/chat/rag/route.ts#L5-L62",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3461bc855a9c950c7cef5610d6a192b4444e6920c3b23daf1389896442fe842f:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/web/app/api/manage/rag/route.ts#L1-L44",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:407601525451f91dc4f7b23149bfc330fc53b285787a2ca29593031bc924a9ef:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/web/lib/tools/rag_search.ts#L15-L20",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0a3a74285bfd534b0f0f668690302621a19a55372fb6a5c61f078742b7c13033:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d5aec1bcf4264577a771fadf83dce607",
      "statement": "Docs selection is constrained to the repository `docs` directory; root aliases select local files excluding remote metadata and add all remote documents, whereas selections inside `docs/remote` interpret JSON `sources` metadata and fetch the referenced URLs.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/web/lib/tools/rag_search.ts#L31-L71",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4a1f98d77719674283bcd428c94455eeb502212f034bbe8b7cc0456d07023484:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/web/lib/tools/rag_search.ts#L78-L168",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4c9d305931c5183b00cdcf6bc486485c2b1896ddc6207de1bcd0cf616a79694e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9b59737e2fa343ea8772108749eff376",
      "statement": "Indexing tolerates malformed remote metadata, unreadable local files, and failed remote fetches by omitting them, but fails when the selected scope yields no readable documents.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/web/lib/tools/rag_search.ts#L140-L167",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4bd9536ef5138ccfbf888d51d86a9e4e25dec62c2dd4d2f38efc725bc1648195:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/web/lib/tools/rag_search.ts#L85-L125",
