        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a73d0737449f4155861039157b1b58e6",
      "statement": "The indexer implements per-source incremental replacement by comparing a SHA-256 content hash stored in a `rag-manifest` record; changed sources delete prior listed chunk IDs, write newly split and embedded chunks to `documents`, then upsert source/hash/chunk-ID metadata, while identical sources are skipped.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/web/lib/tools/rag_search.ts#L221-L289",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a679b7a45362d8ab53d77e9825742d948430cf24cfe400d77c18481622c9435f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d5dc2212475d4af88611440ec6278def",
      "statement": "Documents are split into 1,000-character chunks with 200-character overlap, embedded by `text-embedding-3-small` at 1,024 dimensions, and indexed in batches of eight with a 10-second pause between nonfinal batches.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/web/lib/tools/rag_search.ts#L180-L209",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:abb1daad1c8c65c3149fd4e1692aeffd57f31a466714cbaeca26cee82e037a4d:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/web/lib/tools/rag_search.ts#L258-L268",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a92cca6d96702f81ec3d02aeff67e1130c4555576766e80aa5d1cb886055ce08:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_bba76aa113d144c286d8e8a63c573486",
      "statement": "Index replacement is not transactional: old chunks are deleted before new chunks and manifest metadata are fully written, so an intervening failure can leave the source absent or incomplete; sources omitted from a later selection are not pruned by this loop.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/web/lib/tools/rag_search.ts#L236-L280",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0f1fb9bc0a57c068cdbc296989fa093748befae561c4e8f66023dfa89169df8e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c7fbc18b99c14d5d937a86ae931a62bc",
      "statement": "The management route permits only one in-flight indexing promise per loaded module, returning HTTP 409 to concurrent requests and clearing the guard in `finally` so both failed and successful runs can be retried; it returns 400 for blank folder input and 500 for indexing errors.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/web/app/api/manage/rag/route.ts#L4-L44",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:62505991cb261254fb47c2441bb3aaf10662069f409fb4742cd5495a0a3d5c1e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_896138e26df5415a86f0fd08bab38e3f",
      "statement": "`document_search` retrieves at most four similarity hits, writes Markdown files with source headers under randomized `/retrieved/<id>/chunk_N.md` paths to a shared `StateBackend`, and returns those paths for agent-side analysis.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/web/lib/tools/rag_search.ts#L292-L321",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1053368aec50fc8ed45ce016a856fc32220b6358a348820965d21d19392d5853:"
